{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:524d5ddfb47115a91c3b7d37c7f02b594a1462fadfaf04fd5873f636c936d83f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0216f0138b3cfa38b7a80e64a2d87356be48f76c08db506fccbb740023ade910",
      "text": "辛苦了。今天的工作也平安顺利结束真是太好了呢。\n比预定时间还要早回去呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a155f71a987523298147e79e62f2b0f687bc0e140ccde9b6dd51118c07412701",
      "text": "我说啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n在道别之前……这个给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d452489d8bb1940e4644f3f0bf6e7e1c0fa5d9d15c077614dadd13e403ab8229",
      "text": "作为白色情人节的回礼，\n我准备了我推荐的家电小物件。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b02402fbd57bdf4568d1ca2a89293cbcdfa14bfd0dddaed68e94c6cd2bfcaa6b",
      "text": "不介意的话就用用看吧。是个小尺寸的，\n我想在桌子上也能用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:798c169b496164eb7b4f6654de02e868573cdd8e2327bdb9e9f91f4777f98e17",
      "text": "特意为我准备，非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b66df66e1bef4db3ec40c0502824c37bffc5b961e06dd0614d6f033f2e8e462",
      "text": "我才该说，平时一直多谢你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bbf076f532eee8429a94e2b333d9f991794e6e13cb8749485a2e07a13474f0c",
      "text": "虽说是巧克力的回礼，但除那之外\n平时我也受了你很多照顾吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c3d79bf742c78e833a94cc10547e47f6448eb57bdb71c763db4d9b29592dfe0",
      "text": "嘛，也是倾注了连同那些份在内的感谢之情啦。\n收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb9262116ef7bdf948f6d74d7d5bf2c772a770ab235cbd6ca962df783c7cba5b",
      "text": "真高兴，我会好好珍惜使用的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_23_5_02_009_23:5_02_009_23:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60db5a3402b6b1be487ac16234ab573ae6e5f9586050a5d34e0adfabb401883a",
      "text": "嗯。\n那么，接下来的工作也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
